
Lab 09 (Parts 1 and 2) from the University of Engineering and Technology Peshawar (Nowshera Campus) for 
the Machine Learning Lab course, focusing on mitigating overfitting in Computer Vision models using advanced 
regularization techniques. The workflow covers the configuration of dynamic image augmentation pipelines using Keras 
ImageDataGenerator to artificially expand visual training distributions and enhance model variance (Part 1), 
which is followed by the implementation of a comprehensive comparative evaluation strategy that assesses
multi-class Convolutional Neural Networks (CNNs) across key accuracy thresholds and validation metrics using serialized 
model check-pointing, confusion matrices, and precision-recall statistical reports (Part 2).
